ados, British Virgin Islands, Canada, Ireland, New Zealand, Singapore, South Africa, United Kingdom, United States of America.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extended List</strong></td><td>Bermuda, Botswana, Cayman Islands, Ethiopia, Fiji, Kenya, Malawi, Malta, Mauritius, Seychelles, St Vincent and the Grenadines, Tanzania, Trinidad and Tobago, Vanuatu, Zimbabwe.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>For further details on the English requirements for CDU courses, please refer to the <a href="https://policies.cdu.edu.au/view-current.php?id=178" target='\"_blank\"'>CDU English Language Proficiency Policy</a>.<br/> </p></div></div><div class="spaced-top" data-student-type="international"></div></div></details> </div> </div>',
