rther clarification and information on fees, payment options, instalment plans, and refunds, contact CDU on 1800 061 963 or refer to <a href="https://www.cdu.edu.au/current-students/student-admin/fees-payments#" target="_blank">TAFE Fees and Payments</a>.</p><h4>Fee exemptions</h4><p>Exemptions apply to TAFE tuition fees for NTG supported courses only.</p><p>At the time of enrolment, students in these categories will be <strong>exempt</strong> from paying tuition fees:</p><ul><li>Recipient of a Centrelink payment</li><li>Recipient of Department of Veterans Affairs benefits</li><li>Enrolled Secondary Students</li><li>Permanent residents with refugee or humanitarian status</li></ul><p>Certified copy of the evidence must be provided at the time of enrolment.</p><p>If your course is delivered in a location that is listed on the NTG’s Location Categories for VET Funded Programs, with remote as the location category you may be eligible for the Remote 2 Location tuition fee exemption.</p><p><a href="https://nt.gov.au/learning/adult-education-and-training/for-registered-training-organisations-rtos/delivery-allowance-for-vet-funded-programs" target="_blank">Delivery allowance for VET funded programs</a></p></div><div data-student-type="international"></div></div></details><details class="accordion accordion--divided" data-once="webform-details-save" data-student-type="international"><summary class="accordion__toggle" data-once="webform-details-summary-save" id="accordion-international-vet-package"><h3> International VET Package </h3><span class="button button--small button--icon-only"></span></summary><div class="accordion__content rich-text rich-text--contained"><a href="https://www.cdu.edu.au/international/international-vet-packages">https://www.cdu.edu.au/international/international-vet-packages</a></div></details><details class="accordion accordion--divided" data-once="webform-details-save" data-student-type="both"><summary class="accordion__toggle" data-once="webform-details-summary-save" id="accordion-course-information-flyers"><h3> Course information flyer(s) </h3><span class="button button--small button--icon-only"></span></summary><div class="accordion__content rich-text rich-text--contained"><p><br/><br/><br/><br/><a href="https://www.cdu.edu.au/course-docs/2025/VTP423CIF2025v2.pdf" target='\"_blank\"'>VTP423 Basic Culinary Skills - 2025</a></p></div></details> </div> </div>',
